-- title:
--   Definitions bundle OAIEG003 of the split of OpenAI, A finitely generated counterexample to the Eilenberg–Ganea conjecture
-- statement:
--   A definitions bundle of the split of OpenAI's proof of `OAI.EilenbergGanea.source_main`, carved from OpenAI's openai/math development (OpenAI, *A finitely generated counterexample to the Eilenberg–Ganea conjecture*, OpenAI Math Release, September 23, 2026, result family 249, [github.com/openai/math](https://github.com/openai/math) at commit adc7f12, Apache License 2.0) and ported to Lean 4.33.1 and Mathlib 0df444a. The declarations and their proofs are OpenAI's.
--
--   **Contents.** It holds 18 declarations of OpenAI's Lean: 18 definitions. The definitions and types are `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_0`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_1`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.h1CodeData_10`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_12`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_13`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_3`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_4`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_5`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_6`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_7`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_8`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedChainCertificate.triangleLookupCodes_9`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedEncoding.cellCode`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedEncoding.finite`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.SeedEncoding.sectorCode`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.complexDiagonal`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.complexPolarChart`, `OAI.EilenbergGanea.seedRelator`.
--
--   **Sources.** They come from these modules of lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea, lean/OAI/AlgebraicTopology, lean/OAI/GroupTheory, in whole or in part: [`SeedChains`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedChains.lean), [`SeedContraction`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedContraction.lean), [`SeedHolonomy`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/SeedHolonomy.lean), [`UnitaryWords`](https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/OAI/Topology/EilenbergGanea/UnitaryWords.lean).
